invariant: INV-4
file: handshake_post.c
catches: test/lint-invariants.sh
reason: hspost_read draws a byte into the record buffer before it reads a
  message. handshake_post.c is not one of the six files that hold the
  ten admitted calls, so this is a site nobody audited for seeding, and
  the files rule refuses it.

--- old
    uint8_t *buf = t->cfg.buf;
--- new
    uint8_t *buf = t->cfg.buf;
    ch_rand_bytes(buf, 1);
